## Problem Statement

The application team reported intermittent application slowness and I/O-related failures.

Initial Linux server analysis confirmed:

* No kernel errors
* No filesystem corruption
* No storage errors
* Normal CPU and memory utilization
* Normal Linux I/O statistics

However, VMware generated datastore connectivity events similar to:

```text id="e2xktw"
Lost access to volume Application-recorder due to connectivity issues.
Recovery attempt is in progress.
```

---

## Requirements

* Identify the root cause of the application impact.
* Verify Linux operating system health.
* Investigate VMware infrastructure logs.
* Determine whether the issue originated from the guest OS, ESXi host, storage array, or network.
* Validate datastore recovery.

